 "name_en": "Decentralized EWM – Technical Integration ERP (4UA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Decentralized EWM – Technical Integration ERP (4UA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofc2b69b3783c4e5688362a0218613766\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2b69b3783c4e5688362a0218613766__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With this technical scope item, you can activate the required settings to integrate your <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> ERP system with your decentralized EWM based on SAP S/4HANA system.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">It covers the following aspects of the configuration: Customizing settings in the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> system (which acts as ERP) required for integration with a decentralized EWM based on <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> system. This includes warehouse integration into the SAP ERP enterprise structure and additional data transfer and settings in SAP ERP.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2b69b3783c4e5688362a0218613766__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">This is a technical scope item that enables other processes with decentralized EWM based on <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2b69b3783c4e5688362a0218613766__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Accelerated integration of decentralized EWM based on <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to your SAP S/4HANA ERP system</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>离散型 EWM – 技术集成 ERP (4UA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofc2b69b3783c4e5688362a0218613766\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2b69b3783c4e5688362a0218613766__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过此技术范围项目，您可以激活所需设置，以基于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA 系统将 SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> ERP 系统与分散式 EWM 集成。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">它涵盖配置的以下方面：基于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 系统与分布式 EWM 集成所需的 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 系统（充当 ERP）中的定制设置。这包括将仓库集成到 SAP ERP 企业结构以及 SAP ERP 中的附加数据传输和设置。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2b69b3783c4e5688362a0218613766__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">这是一个技术范围项目，通过基于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 的分散式 EWM 启用其他流程。</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofc2b69b3783c4e5688362a0218613766__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">基于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 的离散型 EWM 加速集成到 SAP S/4HANA ERP 系统</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
